---@class coinbase.CreateSwapQuoteResponse
---@field permit2 coinbase.SwapPermit2Approval|distilled.Null The approval object which contains the necessary fields to submit an approval for this transaction. Null if the `fromToken` is the native token or the transaction is a native token wrap / unwrap.
