---A policy consulted during evaluation, at the version evaluated.
---@class coinbase.EvaluatedPolicy
---@field id string The ID of the policy.
---@field scope coinbase.EvaluatedPolicyScope The scope of the policy.
---@field updatedAt string The version of the policy evaluated. Rule and criterion indices refer to this version.

---The scope of the policy.
---@alias coinbase.EvaluatedPolicyScope "project"|"account"

---The unit this result describes. Present only when the operation was evaluated as more than one unit: one unit per call for user operations, and one unit per signing account for Solana transactions. Each unit is evaluated against the policies separately, and `matchedRule`, `unmatchedRules`, `evaluatedPolicies`, and every observed value describe this unit only. When `action` is `reject`, this is the first unit that was rejected. When `action` is `accept`, every unit was accepted and this is the last one.
---@class coinbase.EvaluatedUnit
---@field index number Zero-based index of the unit. For user operations, this is the index into the operation's `calls`.
---@field count number The number of units the operation was split into.
---@field address? string The Solana signing account of the unit. Omitted for user operations.

