---The status of an EIP-7702 delegation operation.
---@class coinbase.EvmEip7702DelegationOperation
---@field delegationOperationId string The unique identifier for the delegation operation.
---@field status coinbase.EvmEip7702DelegationOperationStatus The current status of the delegation operation. UNSPECIFIED means the status has not been set. PENDING means the operation has been created but not yet submitted. SUBMITTED means the operation has been submitted to the network. COMPLETED means the operation has completed successfully. FAILED means the operation has failed.
