---@class coinbase.ListTransfersRequest
---@field status? coinbase.TransferStatus|string Filter transfers by status. Useful for building dashboards, monitoring active transfers, or finding transfers needing action.
---@field accountId? string Filter transfers by account ID. Returns transfers where the specified account is either the source or target (OR semantics). Cannot be combined with `sourceAccountId`, `targetAccountId`, `sourceAddress`, `targetAddress`, or `targetEmail`.
---@field sourceAccountId? string Filter transfers by source account ID. Returns only transfers where the specified account is the source. Cannot be combined with `accountId` or `sourceAddress`.
---@field targetAccountId? string Filter transfers by target account ID. Returns only transfers where the specified account is the target. Cannot be combined with `accountId`, `targetAddress`, or `targetEmail`.
---@field createdAfter? string Filter transfers to those created at or after this datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 format.
---@field createdBefore? string Filter transfers to those created at or before this datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 format.
---@field updatedAfter? string Filter transfers to those updated at or after this datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 format. Useful for incremental sync — poll for transfers that changed state since your last check.
---@field updatedBefore? string Filter transfers to those updated at or before this datetime (inclusive). ISO 8601 format.
---@field sourceAsset? string Filter transfers by source asset symbol (e.g., `usd`, `usdc`, `eurc`, `eur`).
---@field targetAsset? string Filter transfers by target asset symbol (e.g., `usdc`, `eurc`, `usd`, `eur`).
---@field sourceAddress? string Filter transfers by the on-chain address of the source. Cannot be combined with `accountId` or `sourceAccountId`.
---@field targetAddress? string Filter transfers by the on-chain destination address of the target. Cannot be combined with `accountId`, `targetAccountId`, or `targetEmail`.
---@field targetEmail? string Filter transfers by the email address of the target recipient. Cannot be combined with `accountId`, `targetAccountId`, or `targetAddress`.
---@field transferId? string Filter to a specific transfer by ID. When provided, returns only the matching transfer and bypasses pagination. Cannot be combined with any other filter.
---@field pageSize? number The number of resources to return per page.
---@field pageToken? string The token for the next page of resources, if any.

---@class coinbase.ListTransfersResponse
---@field transfers coinbase.ListTransfersResponseTransfersList The list of transfers.
---@field nextPageToken? string The token for the next page of items, if any.

---The list of transfers.
