---@field upgradeUrl string The Coinbase-hosted URL where the user enters identity information for the limit upgrade. Treat the session token in this URL as opaque.
---@field expiresAt string The time at which the hosted limit upgrade URL expires. Request a new upgrade URL after this time.

---The identity field key for limit upgrades. These keys correspond to the fields
---in the limits upgrade request:
---- `ssnLast4`: Last 4 digits of the Social Security Number
---- `dateOfBirth`: Date of birth
---@alias coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeIdentityFieldKey "ssnLast4"|"dateOfBirth"

---Populate the properties that correspond to the `fields` array from the user's `OnrampLimitUpgradeOption`.
---@class coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeIdentityFields
---@field ssnLast4? string Last 4 digits of the Social Security Number (no dashes or spaces).
---@field dateOfBirth? coinbase.DateOfBirth Date of birth.

---The interaction mode for the limit upgrade request:
---- `api`: Submit identity fields directly in the API request.
---- `embedded`: Return a Coinbase-hosted URL where the user enters identity fields.
---@alias coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeInteractionMode "api"|"embedded"

