---@field fields coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeOptionFieldsList The identity fields associated with the current status. Contains fields to submit for `unrequested` and `resubmit`, fields pending review for `pending`, and is empty for `active` and `inactive`.
---@field limitUpgrades coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeOptionLimitUpgradesList The limit values associated with this upgrade.

---The identity fields associated with the current status. Contains fields to submit for `unrequested` and `resubmit`, fields pending review for `pending`, and is empty for `active` and `inactive`.
---@alias coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeOptionFieldsList coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeIdentityFieldKey[]

---The limit values associated with this upgrade.
---@alias coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeOptionLimitUpgradesList coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgrade[]

---The status of verification:
---- `unrequested`: The limit upgrade has not been submitted.
---- `resubmit`: One or more identity fields must be resubmitted.
---- `pending`: The submitted identity fields are pending review.
---- `active`: The limit upgrade is active.
---- `inactive`: The limit upgrade was rejected and cannot be resubmitted.
---@alias coinbase.OnrampLimitUpgradeStatus "unrequested"|"resubmit"|"pending"|"active"|"inactive"

---A server-issued challenge for platform attestation in an App2App onramp handoff.
---@class coinbase.OnrampMobileChallenge
---@field challenge string An opaque server-issued token to be used with platform attestation (iOS App Attest or Android Play Integrity Standard). Treat it as an opaque string — do not attempt to parse its contents. Pass this value along with the attestation payload to the [Create Onramp Mobile Session](#operation/createOnrampMobileSession) endpoint to complete the App2App handoff. **iOS**: pass this value directly to `DCAppAttestService.generateAssertion(keyId, clientDataHash: SHA256(challenge))`. **Android**: compute `requestHash = base64url(SHA256(challenge))` and pass it to `StandardIntegrityManager.requestToken(requestHash)`.
---@field expiresAt string The time at which the challenge expires. Challenges are short-lived; submit the attestation to [Create Onramp Mobile Session](#operation/createOnrampMobileSession) before this time or request a new challenge.

