---@param input? coinbase.CreateEvmAccountRequest
---@return coinbase.EvmAccount? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_evm_account(input) end

---Create EIP-7702 delegation
---
---Creates an EIP-7702 delegation for an EVM EOA account, upgrading it with smart account capabilities.
---
---This endpoint:
---- Retrieves delegation artifacts from onchain
---- Signs the EIP-7702 authorization for delegation
---- Assembles and submits a Type 4 transaction
---- Creates an associated smart account object
---
---The delegation allows the EVM EOA to be used as a smart account, which enables batched transactions and gas sponsorship via paymaster.
---
---`POST /v2/evm/accounts/{address}/eip7702/delegation`
---@param input coinbase.CreateEvmEip7702DelegationRequest
---@return coinbase.CreateEvmEip7702DelegationResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_evm_eip7702_delegation(input) end

---Create EIP-7702 delegation for end user EVM account
---
---Creates an EIP-7702 delegation for an end user's EVM EOA account, upgrading it with smart account capabilities.
---
---This endpoint:
---- Retrieves delegation artifacts from onchain
---- Signs the EIP-7702 authorization for delegation
---- Assembles and submits a Type 4 transaction
---- Creates an associated smart account object
---
---The delegation allows the EVM EOA to be used as a smart account, which enables batched transactions and gas sponsorship via paymaster.
---
---`POST /v2/embedded-wallet-api/end-users/{userId}/evm/eip7702/delegation`
---@param input coinbase.CreateEvmEip7702DelegationWithEndUserAccountRequest
---@return coinbase.CreateEvmEip7702DelegationWithEndUserAccountResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_evm_eip7702_delegation_with_end_user_account(input) end

