---Void a payment session
---
---Releases all remaining capturable funds back to the payer. The session must have a positive `capturable` balance.
---
---This is an asynchronous operation. The void is returned in `pending` status and transitions to `succeeded` or `failed`.
---
---After voiding, no further captures can be made. Unlike **Cancel**, which works before authorization, void works after authorization.
---
---`POST /v2/payment-sessions/{paymentSessionId}/voids`
---@param input coinbase.VoidPaymentSessionRequest
---@return coinbase.Void? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:void_payment_session(input) end

